      <h1>How the Lightning Network Works</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Lightning moves bitcoin through bilateral payment channels anchored to enforceable Bitcoin transactions. Learn how channel states, routed HTLC payments, onion routing, liquidity, fees, custody arrangements, privacy limits, and on-chain settlement fit together without treating fast payments, privacy, or self-custody as guarantees.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Layer 2</li><li>Shallow</li><li>Explainer</li><li>14 to 17 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-22</li></ul>
